{
    "background_story": "Hunky was a rugged, no-nonsense man who spent his life as a watchman on the remote lighthouse island of Ravenswood. For over 20 years, he kept vigil over the rocky shores, warning ships of impending danger and ensuring the safety of the coastal community. Hunky's keen eyesight and instincts made him a legendary figure among sailors and locals alike. He took his responsibility seriously, braving treacherous storms and isolation to keep the light burning bright. Despite his tough exterior, Hunky had a soft spot for the sea and its creatures, often rescuing stranded seals and seabirds. As the years passed, Hunky became an institution on Ravenswood, his name synonymous with bravery, loyalty, and dedication to duty.",
